( https://albiononline.com/news/fame-boost-december-2021 )

Adventurer,

As the year draws to a close and the chill winter air settles over the land=
, the *Mists of Albion* ( https://albiononline.com/news/fame-boost-december=
-2021 ) are rising again! From now until *10:00 UTC on December 30* , you=
=E2=80=99ll enjoy a *25% Fame buff*. Think of it as our gift to you! (Note =
that the buff does *not* apply to Fame earned via PvP kills and Tomes of In=
sight, and does not boost the rate at which Challenge Points are earned.)

This is the perfect opportunity to unlock *Elite Levels* or work on that ne=
w weapon line you=E2=80=99ve been thinking about. The buff is automatically=
 applied to everyone so there=E2=80=99s nothing extra you need to do. Just =
head into Albion and get active!

( https://albiononline.com/news/uncle-frost-2021 )

Uncle Frost is Back
-------------------

Meanwhile, a strange, bearded figure has been seen prowling around the dept=
hs of Albion=E2=80=99s dungeons. That=E2=80=99s right, *Uncle Frost* ( http=
s://albiononline.com/news/uncle-frost-2021 ) has returned!

This enigmatic character has a chance to appear at the end of any T4+ Solo =
or Group Randomized Dungeon across all factions and zones until December 30=
 =E2=80=93 just look for the *Christmas trees* as you approach the end of a=
 dungeon. If you manage to find and defeat him, you can unlock the final ch=
est for a chance at special Yule-themed items including the rare *Yule Stag=
* mount skin.

To help celebrate the season (and show there's no hard feelings), Uncle Fro=
st has also sent *fireworks and snowballs* to all players. To claim them, a=
ll you need to do is log into the game before December 30. So grab your gif=
ts and join in the festivities!

( https://albiononline.com/news/demonic-warrior )

What if Yuletide celebrations aren=E2=80=99t for you? Then grab our new *De=
monic Warrior Vanity Bundle* and crash the party:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/demonic-warrior )

